*.egg
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-*
after-login.png


# Django uploaded media (user-generated content, not source code)
apps/api/media/
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. An unanchored `media/` also matched
# apps/web/media/ and apps/web/public/media/, which hold frontend design assets
# the Next.js build imports directly — leaving them untracked broke the Vercel
# build with "module not found" on login/register.
/media/

